/E (Blanche went on to be a DJ and then to run a Florida radio franchise, before returning to Baltimore to marry her high-school sweetheart, and go on to build a Black cosmetics company. Brother Cab Calloway, incidentally, got his break in show business through Blanche and his performance style echoed many of her trademark moves. )
